@host = http://localhost:5160
@authToken = <your-jwt-token-here>
@routeUid = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Obtener todas las vías de escalada
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Obtener vías con filtros
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute?climbZoneId=1&difficultyScaleNameId=1&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Obtener una vía por UID
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute/{{routeUid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Crear una vía de escalada
POST {{host}}/api/climbRoute
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "La Huella del Oso",
  "description": "Vía de escalada deportiva con fuerte crux en el segundo tercio",
  "difficultyScaleId": 1,
  "difficultyScaleNameId": 1,
  "climbTagId": null,
  "pitchCount": 1,
  "firstAscentDate": "2023-06-15T00:00:00Z",
  "climbZoneId": 1
}

###

### 5. Actualizar una vía
PUT {{host}}/api/climbRoute/{{routeUid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "La Huella del Oso - Variante",
  "description": "Descripción actualizada",
  "difficultyScaleId": 2,
  "climbTagId": null,
  "pitchCount": 2,
  "climbZoneId": 1
}

###

### 6. Eliminar una vía
DELETE {{host}}/api/climbRoute/{{routeUid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 7. Obtener escalas de dificultad
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute/difficulty-scales
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Obtener escalas de dificultad por nombre de escala
GET {{host}}/api/climbRoute/difficulty-scales?difficultyScaleNameId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
